      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "A5BC9097F6D8D2BA",
      "text": "Bravo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Vous avez parfaitement\\ninterprété la forme de ce versant ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_02",
      "hash64": "A5BC8F97F6D8D107",
      "text": "Vous y voyez une oreille qui se diviserait\\nen trois parties ?\\c\\nIl est vrai qu’en se basant sur un Pokémon comme\\nLeveinard, votre réponse serait correcte.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 155,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_answer_03",
      "hash64": "A5BC8E97F6D8CF54",
      "text": "Vous y voyez une queue qui se diviserait\\nen trois parties ?\\c\\nIl est vrai qu’en se basant sur un Pokémon comme\\nTauros, votre réponse serait correcte.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "F723C35829571EA8",
      "text": "On appelle ce versant en trois parties\\nla [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Main Nappée[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "F723C658295723C1",
      "text": "La forme de cette main semble un peu courte\\net large pour qu’il s’agisse d’une main humaine.\\c\\nJ’imagine que si un Pokémon a servi d’inspiration\\npour le nom, on devrait plutôt dire une « patte ».[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 196,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "F723C5582957220E",
      "text": "Par ailleurs, les hauteurs de la zone montagneuse\\nde la Zone Est nº 3 offrent une vue exceptionnelle\\r\\nsur Levalendura. C’est particulièrement vrai\\r\\nune fois la nuit tombée.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 176,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_18",
      "hash64": "F723C0582957198F",
      "text": "On appelle d’ailleurs ce panorama à couper\\nle souffle la [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Vue Nocturne du Tonnerre[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_19",
      "hash64": "F723BF58295717DC",
      "text": "On dit que c’est un endroit très apprécié des\\ncouples en quête d’un rendez-vous romantique.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_20",
      "hash64": "F7193658294DDA8C",
      "text": "Mais j’imagine que des jeunes comme vous\\nparleraient plutôt d’un bon « spot à selfie ».\\c\\n... C’est cela ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_06_dragon_21",
      "hash64": "F7193758294DDC3F",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, même si l’on fait généralement\\nl’éloge de ces paysages, on peut penser que les\\r\\nappeler « des merveilles » est un peu exagéré.\\c\\nAprès tout, nous avons tous déjà été déçus par\\nun lieu touristique en vogue, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 243,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
